SignatureAdviceTextImageRatio=Add real text (name, role, contact details). A signature made mostly of images disappears when images are blocked.
SignatureCheckImageCount=Number of images
SignatureAdviceImageCount=Keep to a logo and, at most, a small strip of social icons.
SignatureCheckImageAlt=Image alternative text
SignatureAdviceImageAlt=Set an alt attribute on every image so it degrades gracefully when images are turned off.
SignatureCheckImageWeight=Image weight
SignatureAdviceImageWeight=Avoid inline base64 images and oversized widths; host the logo and link to it instead.
SignatureCheckLinkCount=Number of links
SignatureAdviceLinkCount=Too many links looks like spam. Keep only the essential ones.
SignatureCheckTextLength=Text length
SignatureAdviceTextLength=Shorten the signature to a few lines.
